Package: com.gokuencinar.bandlock
Name: BandLock (RootHide LTE Analyzer iOS 18 Preview)
Version: 1.6.0~rhui2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Experimental RootHide LTE analyzer preview with modern UI, typed passive monitoring and private local history. On iOS 18, changing bands, RAT and active scans are deliberately disabled pending hardware validation; emergency recovery remains possible.
Maintainer: Gokuencinar
Author: Gokuencinar
Section: Tweaks
Homepage: https://github.com/Gokuencinar/GokuEnREPO/blob/main/tweaks/BandLock/README.md
